<section id="about" class="[background:#12170C]">
  <div class="wrap personal-grid screen gap-y-10 pt-20 pb-20">
    <div
      class="sec-body about-grid grid [grid-template-columns:repeat(9,_minmax(0,_1fr))] gap-x-6 gap-y-10"
    >
      <h2 class="d h2 col-span-full">
        Based in Bangladesh. Building for the web.
      </h2>
      <img
        loading="lazy"
        width="724"
        height="1056"
        src="/images/personal/portrait.jpg"
        alt="Portrait of Mehedi Sharif"
        class="[grid-column:1_/_span_4] block w-full [aspect-ratio:5_/_6] object-cover [object-position:50%_30%]"
      />
      <div class="[grid-column:5_/_span_5] flex flex-col gap-5 self-end">
        <p class="m-0">
          I’m a founder and developer. I like making useful things and then
          building the business that keeps them going.
        </p>
        <p class="m-0">
          My companies are Themefisher, UIHut, Zeon Studio and SitePins. Right
          now most of my time goes into GHL MegaMinds, my newest venture. I’m
          also a GoHighLevel Certified Admin.
        </p>
        <p class="m-0">
          <span class="ph"
            >[One or two personal lines — where you grew up, how you got into
            building.]</span>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
